---
import { PRODUCT_NAME } from '../../config';
---
<section class="s wrap rule" aria-labelledby="lanes-h">
  <div class="fit-head">
    <h2 id="lanes-h">Your agents write it. <span class="soft">You land it.</span></h2>
    <p>Keep the agents you already run. {PRODUCT_NAME} reads the branches and PRs they open, and helps you land them.</p>
  </div>

  <svg class="lanes" viewBox="0 0 1288 420" role="img" aria-label={`Five branches leave main and pass through ${PRODUCT_NAME}. One is stuck at a conflict, one is still in progress, and three merge into main in order with no conflicts.`}>
    <defs>
      <linearGradient id="lp-lit" x1="0" y1="0" x2="0" y2="1"><stop offset="0" style="stop-color:var(--accent);stop-opacity:.14"/><stop offset=".25" style="stop-color:var(--accent);stop-opacity:.08"/><stop offset=".5" style="stop-color:var(--accent);stop-opacity:.035"/><stop offset=".75" style="stop-color:var(--accent);stop-opacity:.01"/><stop offset="1" style="stop-color:var(--accent);stop-opacity:0"/></linearGradient>
      <linearGradient id="lp-fade" gradientUnits="userSpaceOnUse" x1="850" y1="0" x2="1258" y2="0"><stop offset="0" style="stop-color:var(--lane-3)"/><stop offset="1" style="stop-color:var(--lane-3);stop-opacity:0"/></linearGradient>
    </defs>
    <rect x="700" y="14" width="150" height="392" rx="16" fill="url(#lp-lit)"/>
    <rect x="700" y="14" width="150" height="392" rx="16" fill="none" style="stroke:var(--line)"/>
    <rect x="718" y="32" width="12" height="12" rx="3" style="fill:var(--accent)"/>
    <text class="band-t" x="736" y="43">{PRODUCT_NAME}</text>
    <path class="ln main" d="M0 370 H1288"/>
    <text class="sub" x="0" y="398">main</text>
    <path id="lp-l1" class="ln" style="stroke:var(--lane-1)" d="M0 370 C 200.0 370, 200.0 110, 400 110 H 850"/>
    <circle cx="850" cy="110" r="3" style="fill:var(--red)"/>
    <path id="lp-l2" class="ln" style="stroke:var(--lane-3)" d="M55 370 C 231.0 370, 231.0 158, 407 158 H 850"/>
    <path id="lp-l3" class="ln" style="stroke:var(--lane-4)" d="M110 370 C 262.0 370, 262.0 206, 414 206 H 904 C 1056.0 206, 1056.0 370, 1208 370"/>
    <path id="lp-l4" class="ln" style="opacity:.75;stroke:var(--lane-1)" d="M165 370 C 293.0 370, 293.0 254, 421 254 H 897 C 1025.0 254, 1025.0 370, 1153 370"/>
    <path id="lp-l5" class="ln" style="opacity:.75;stroke:var(--lane-3)" d="M220 370 C 324.0 370, 324.0 302, 428 302 H 890 C 994.0 302, 994.0 370, 1098 370"/>
    <path class="ln" style="stroke:url(#lp-fade)" d="M850 158 H 1258"/>
    <text class="lbl" x="414" y="98">Agent in a worktree</text><text class="sub" x="554" y="98">#118</text>
    <text class="lbl" x="421" y="146">Agent in the cloud</text><text class="sub" x="551" y="146">#123</text>
    <text class="lbl" x="428" y="194">Agent in the cloud</text><text class="sub" x="558" y="194">#121</text>
    <text class="lbl" x="435" y="242">Agent in a worktree</text><text class="sub" x="575" y="242">#120</text>
    <text class="lbl" x="442" y="290">A teammate</text><text class="sub" x="528" y="290">#119</text>
    <text class="sub" x="1258" y="146" text-anchor="end" style="fill:var(--text-4)">still working</text>
    <g class="dot"><circle r="3.5" style="fill:var(--lane-1)"><animateMotion dur="4.2s" begin=".4s" repeatCount="indefinite"><mpath href="#lp-l1"/></animateMotion></circle><circle r="3.5" style="fill:var(--lane-3)"><animateMotion dur="5s" begin="2.2s" repeatCount="indefinite"><mpath href="#lp-l2"/></animateMotion></circle><circle r="3.5" style="fill:var(--lane-4)"><animateMotion dur="6.2s" begin="1.6s" repeatCount="indefinite"><mpath href="#lp-l3"/></animateMotion></circle><circle r="3.5" style="fill:var(--lane-1)"><animateMotion dur="5.8s" begin=".8s" repeatCount="indefinite"><mpath href="#lp-l4"/></animateMotion></circle><circle r="3.5" style="fill:var(--lane-3)"><animateMotion dur="5.2s" begin="0s" repeatCount="indefinite"><mpath href="#lp-l5"/></animateMotion></circle></g>
    <g class="pill red"><rect x="717" y="98" width="116" height="24" rx="12"/><text x="775" y="114" text-anchor="middle">stuck · conflict</text></g>
    <g class="pill "><rect x="717" y="146" width="116" height="24" rx="12"/><text x="775" y="162" text-anchor="middle">in progress</text></g>
    <g class="pill green"><rect x="717" y="194" width="116" height="24" rx="12"/><text x="775" y="210" text-anchor="middle">ready · 3rd</text></g>
    <g class="pill green"><rect x="717" y="242" width="116" height="24" rx="12"/><text x="775" y="258" text-anchor="middle">ready · 2nd</text></g>
    <g class="pill green"><rect x="717" y="290" width="116" height="24" rx="12"/><text x="775" y="306" text-anchor="middle">ready · 1st</text></g>
    <circle class="node" cx="1098" cy="370" r="9" style="fill:var(--lane-3)"/><text class="ord" x="1098" y="374" text-anchor="middle">1</text>
    <circle class="node" cx="1153" cy="370" r="9" style="fill:var(--lane-1)"/><text class="ord" x="1153" y="374" text-anchor="middle">2</text>
    <circle class="node" cx="1208" cy="370" r="9" style="fill:var(--lane-4)"/><text class="ord" x="1208" y="374" text-anchor="middle">3</text>
  </svg>

  <div class="fit-facts">
    <div><h3>Any agent</h3><p>It never launches or controls an agent. If it opens a branch or a PR, {PRODUCT_NAME} sees it, in a worktree or in the cloud.</p></div>
    <div><h3>Local first</h3><p>Diffs and merge checks are worked out on your Mac, with your own git. Your code never leaves it. GitHub only comes in when you turn pull requests on.</p></div>
    <div><h3><kbd>⌘Z</kbd> for anything local</h3><p>Cleanups, rebases, resets and deleted branches all undo. Merges on GitHub are the one thing it asks about first.</p></div>
  </div>
</section>
